 "summary": "Seven single-phase full-wave bridge rectifiers in the four-lead through-hole GBU plastic case, alike except for reverse voltage, which runs from 50 V (GBU10005) to 1000 V (GBU1010). Each carries 10 A average output and takes a 175 A one-shot surge over an 8.3 ms half sine. Forward drop is at most 1.05 V at 5 A. The mould compound is rated UL 94V-0, and the parts are RoHS-compliant and halogen-free.",
